{
  "category": "Overturning Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "It wields the most compelling hypnotic powers of any Pokémon, and it forces others to do whatever it wants.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "It lures its prey close with hypnotic motions, then wraps its tentacles around it before finishing it off with digestive fluids.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "It wields the most compelling hypnotic powers of any Pokémon, and it forces others to do whatever it wants.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "It lures its prey close with hypnotic motions, then wraps its tentacles around it before finishing it off with digestive fluids.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it comes to strong hypnosis, there’s an endless number of people who utilize Malamar for their nefarious deeds.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It flashes the pattern on its torso to control its prey and draw them in. The edges of its fins are supremely sharp.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gazing at its luminescent spots will quickly induce a hypnotic state, putting the observer under Malamar’s control.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s said that Malamar’s hypnotic powers played a role in certain history-changing events.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
